+CMR     -CH-CH2-CH2-    Ring B/C
+CMR5    -CH2-CH2-CH-    Ring D
+CTB     -CH2-CH-CH3-    Tail
+CTBA    -C-CH3          Ring A/B
+CTBB    -C-CH3          Ring C/D
+OAB     -CH-OH          Ring A
+
+See the provided reference for details on the CG cholesterol topology. 
+A 5-10 timestep is used when using cholesterol.
